## two requests, with and without arguments
{"seq":1,"command":"initialize","arguments":{"adapterID":"spectec"}}
{"seq":2,"command":"threads","arguments":null}
(end of input)

## empty input
(end of input)

## other headers, LF line endings and any header case
{"seq":3,"command":"configurationDone","arguments":null}
(end of input)

## length counts bytes, not characters
{"seq":4,"command":"evaluate","arguments":{"expression":"λx"}}
(end of input)

## missing Content-Length
protocol error: Message header has no Content-Length.

## bad Content-Length
protocol error: Bad Content-Length `-3`.

## malformed header
protocol error: Malformed header line `Content-Length 12`.

## input ends in the header
protocol error: Input ended inside a message header.

## input ends in the body
protocol error: Input ended inside a message body.

## not JSON
protocol error: Message is not JSON: Line 1, bytes 4-5:
Unexpected end of input

## not a request
protocol error: Expected a request, got a response.

## request without a command
protocol error: Message has no valid `command`.

## respond
Content-Length: 81\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"response","request_seq":7,"success":true,"command":"stackTrace"}

## respond with a body
Content-Length: 106\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"response","request_seq":7,"success":true,"command":"stackTrace","body":{"totalFrames":0}}

## respond_error
Content-Length: 115\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"response","request_seq":7,"success":false,"command":"stackTrace","message":"No call in progress."}

## send_event
Content-Length: 46\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"event","event":"initialized"}

## send_event with a body
Content-Length: 73\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"event","event":"stopped","body":{"reason":"breakpoint"}}

## seq counts each message on a connection
Content-Length: 81\r\n\r\n
{"seq":1,"type":"response","request_seq":7,"success":true,"command":"stackTrace"}
Content-Length: 46\r\n\r\n
{"seq":2,"type":"event","event":"initialized"}
Content-Length: 45\r\n\r\n
{"seq":3,"type":"event","event":"terminated"}

